  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest nature reserve in the direction of east starting from Ganyard Hill Farms, Durham, NC?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-78.811548 35.958684)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'nature_reserve'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
